{"id":"H4447","lemma":"הַמֹּלֶכֶת","transliteration":"molekhet","sayIt":"mo-le-khet","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Hammolecheth","meaning":"A woman of the tribe of Manasseh living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, only mentioned at 1Ch.7.18;\ndaughter of: Machir (H4353);\nsister of: Gilead (H1568H), daughter_of_Machir (H4353I), Peresh (H6570) and Sheresh (H8329);\nmother of: Ishhod (H0379), Abiezer (H0044H) and Mahlah (H4244H)\n§ Hammoleketh = \"the queen\"\ndaughter of Machir and sister of Gilead","glosses":["hammolecheth"],"count":1,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-7","v":18,"renderings":{"bsb":"Hammolecheth","kjv":"Hammoleketh"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 7:18","note":"His sister Hammolecheth bore Ishhod, Abiezer, and Mahlah.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H4353","lemma":"מָכִיר","transliteration":"makhir","gloss":"Machir"},{"id":"H0044","lemma":"אֲבִיעֶ֫זֶר","transliteration":"aviezer","gloss":"Abiezer"},{"id":"H0379","lemma":"אִישְׁהוֹד","transliteration":"ishhod","gloss":"Ishhod"},{"id":"H1568","lemma":"גִּלְעָד","transliteration":"gilad","gloss":"Gilead"},{"id":"H4244","lemma":"מַחְלָה","transliteration":"machlah","gloss":"Mahlah"},{"id":"H6570","lemma":"פֶּ֫רֶשׁ","transliteration":"peresh","gloss":"Peresh"},{"id":"H8329","lemma":"שָׁ֑רֶשׁ","transliteration":"sheresh","gloss":"Sheresh"},{"id":"H4354","lemma":"מָכִירִי","transliteration":"makhiri","gloss":"Machirite"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}